# AddressSanitizer runtime suppressions
# Suppresses errors in external (non-recompiled) shared libraries only.
# Loaded via: ASAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=$PWD/suppressions/asan.supp
#
# This does NOT affect code we compile ourselves with ASan.
# If you need to suppress a false positive in our own code, use the
# compile-time ignorelist (asan_ignorelist.txt) or __attribute__((no_sanitize)).
#
# Format:
#   interceptor_via_fun:NameOfCFunction
#   interceptor_via_lib:NameOfTheLibrary
